This repository contains no third-party code. zprof is built and run with
the following, each under its own licence and none of it copied here:

- Zephyr RTOS (Apache-2.0): the firmware module is built inside a Zephyr
  application; scripts/gen_trace_defaults.py generates code from the Zephyr
  tree's include/zephyr/tracing/tracing.h at configure time.
- Sferic Charts (MIT, https://github.com/murr2k/sferic-charts): the dashboard
  imports it from source.
- The npm packages in web/package-lock.json and the Python packages in
  host/bridge/requirements.txt and host/svd/requirements.txt.
- ST's SVD for the STM32N657 (Apache-2.0): host/svd/svd_workbook.py reads it
  from ST's download; ST's text in the workbook it builds remains ST's.
